{"ID":"20251031162713-18bjuj5","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251031162713-18bjuj5","title":"UPL7-8——碰撞检测相关","type":"doc","updated":"20251103112402"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031162713-tmssqjw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251031162713-tmssqjw","updated":"20251103111538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合理利用碰撞层矩阵设置"}]},{"ID":"20251031172949-2nts0mw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031172949-2nts0mw","updated":"20251103111538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"想要减小碰撞检测带来的开销，根本上就是要减少碰撞候选对的产生\n所谓的 候选对 就是指，在广义检测 / 粗检测（Broadphase）阶段得到的一组可能相交的物体对\n产生的候选对越多，在下一步进行 狭义检测 / 精检测（Narrowphase）的工作量就越大，CPU 压力就越大"}]},{"ID":"20251031172949-ykbrnek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031172949-ykbrnek","updated":"20251031173022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此，我们应该尽量避免无意义的碰撞产生，最有效直接的方式就是利用碰撞层矩阵\n让无关层（相互之间不需要发生碰撞检测的层）全部互斥，这样可以大幅减少候选对的产生，从而达到优化性能的目的"}]},{"ID":"20251031173035-77360ke","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251031173035-77360ke","name":"Physics.IgnoreCollision()","updated":"20251103111705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"利用 Physics 公共类 API 单独忽略物体碰撞"}]},{"ID":"20251031173044-xu4x2xz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173044-xu4x2xz","updated":"20251031173141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有时可能通过 碰撞层矩阵 不太好进行碰撞忽略，比如处于某两层中的物体，并不是所有都不需要碰撞检测，而只希望个别忽略"}]},{"ID":"20251031173140-egyuc8m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173140-egyuc8m","updated":"20251031173140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"举例："}]},{"ID":"20251031173138-ypb64wy","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031173138-ypb64wy","updated":"20251031173153"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031173138-nai5sy1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031173138-nai5sy1","updated":"20251031173153"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031173138-t6tnjut","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173138-t6tnjut","updated":"20251031173153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"角色丢出的手榴弹，不要和自己身上的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Collider"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 撞到"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031173138-6bpcxym","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251031173138-6bpcxym","updated":"20251031173150"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031173138-p2qkb93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173138-p2qkb93","updated":"20251031173150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"近战武器的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Collider"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 要忽略和角色自身的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Collider"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的碰撞"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031173137-5tr64i8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173137-5tr64i8","updated":"20251031173137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20251031173137-rrbox5h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173137-rrbox5h","updated":"20251031173137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果只是想控制个别对象之间的碰撞检测忽略，我们可以利用物理公共类中的忽略碰撞方法"}]},{"ID":"20251031173053-q0805ni","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251031173053-q0805ni","updated":"20251103111705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"class Physics\n{\n    public static void IgnoreCollision(Collider collider1, Collider collider2, bool ignore = true)；\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20251031173048-6jgaih0","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251031173048-6jgaih0","updated":"20251031173129"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031173118-1gfi5v7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251031173118-1gfi5v7","updated":"20251031173121"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031173118-d93v1e3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173118-d93v1e3","updated":"20251031173121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"参数 1：碰撞体A"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031173119-5wjk9ay","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251031173119-5wjk9ay","updated":"20251031173121"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031173119-ixo0x7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173119-ixo0x7x","updated":"20251031173121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"参数 2：碰撞体B"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031173119-6xza7m3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251031173119-6xza7m3","updated":"20251031173129"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031173119-diczjxl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173119-diczjxl","updated":"20251031173129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"参数 3：是否忽略碰撞检测，传 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"true"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 就不会对两个对象进行碰撞检测，传 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"false"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 就会恢复检测"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031173113-jfkbcmn","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251031173113-jfkbcmn","updated":"20251031173115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"Physics.IgnoreCollision(a, b, false);\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20251031173212-bdpaswb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251031173212-bdpaswb","updated":"20251103111925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"避免全局粗检测（Broadphase）重建"}]},{"ID":"20251031173231-yo5g0vj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173231-yo5g0vj","updated":"20251031173315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通过之前的学习我们知道，Broadphase（粗检测） 负责快速判断哪些物体 可能相交（生成候选对）\n它通常用 空间分区结构（例如动态 BVH、四叉树、八叉树 等），这些结构的核心就是 AABB（Axis-Aligned Bounding Box）\n每个 碰撞体（Collider） 都有一个 AABB，它的处理逻辑就是：利用所有物体的 AABB 计算出 候选对（可能相交的对象）"}]},{"ID":"20251031173231-gabdwd0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173231-gabdwd0","updated":"20251103111807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"AABB：轴对齐包围盒的简称\n原理是用一个长方体，它的六个面分别平行于 X、Y、Z 轴，用来包住某个物体，利用这种规则粗略的表示一个对象的体积范围"}]},{"ID":"20251103111807-uc3tgv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251103111807-uc3tgv9","updated":"20251103111836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251103111829-ebd5etj.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251031173231-uv0n8w3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173231-uv0n8w3","updated":"20251031173416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而粗检测重建指的就是：当物体的 位置、旋转、缩放 变化很大，或者 静态碰撞体（只挂碰撞器组件的对象） 被移动时\n引擎不得不重新构建空间分区结构，以保证 AABB 数据正确，这意味着原来的 Broadphase 树、格子、排序信息会被废弃，必须重新插入或重排节点\n这是一个 非常消耗性能的 CPU 操作，尤其是大场景或碰撞器很多时，因此我们要尽量避免这种情况的发生"}]},{"ID":"20251031173231-l0wctsw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173231-l0wctsw","updated":"20251031173447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"何时会触发重建："}]},{"ID":"20251031173422-n7lxd7c","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031173422-n7lxd7c","updated":"20251103111925"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031173422-f2vkmmp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031173422-f2vkmmp","updated":"20251103111919"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031173422-5gvnr38","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173422-5gvnr38","updated":"20251103111919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"移动静态碰撞体（只挂碰撞器组件的对象）"}]},{"ID":"20251031173423-ss060ru","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173423-ss060ru","updated":"20251031173427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果你直接改 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"transform.position"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，会导致引擎强制重建整个粗检测（Broadphase）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031173422-pyxgq5m","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251031173422-pyxgq5m","updated":"20251103111925"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031173422-zrw3nb4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173422-zrw3nb4","updated":"20251103111925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瞬移动态碰撞体（挂载刚体和碰撞器组件的对象）"}]},{"ID":"20251031173437-sdjxsjp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173437-sdjxsjp","updated":"20251031173437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果你在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Update"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 里直接改刚体的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"transform"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，相当于“瞬移”，也会触发重建"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031173422-d1r4hoq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251031173422-d1r4hoq","updated":"20251031173422"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031173422-17ytum3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173422-17ytum3","updated":"20251031173422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"缩放改变"}]},{"ID":"20251031173439-mbcmheo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173439-mbcmheo","updated":"20251031173445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"改 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Collider"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的尺寸，导致 AABB 改变，节点重插"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031173422-vp31kfy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251031173422-vp31kfy","updated":"20251031173422"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031173422-j8tg8vt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173422-j8tg8vt","updated":"20251031173422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"启用/禁用 Collider"}]},{"ID":"20251031173449-6cblps2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173449-6cblps2","updated":"20251031173449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"会在粗检测（Broadphase）树中添加或移除节点"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031173422-3q052lg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20251031173422-3q052lg","updated":"20251031173501"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031173422-ri8nazk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173422-ri8nazk","updated":"20251031173457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大量物体被 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Instantiate"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 或 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Destroy"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251031173451-5mj28mv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173451-5mj28mv","updated":"20251031173501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每次实例化、销毁碰撞体，粗检测（Broadphase）都要插入或删除节点，大量操作会触发局部甚至全局重建"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031173231-v4reow6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173231-v4reow6","updated":"20251031173231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此我们应该在开发时尽量控制这些问题带来的开销"}]},{"ID":"20251031173513-8xvu56k","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251031173513-8xvu56k","updated":"20251031173656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"降低误配对和过度接触"}]},{"ID":"20251031173519-t12nner","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031173519-t12nner","updated":"20251031173641"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031173524-kr6r6sv","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031173524-kr6r6sv","updated":"20251031173547"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031173524-4404s0x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173524-4404s0x","updated":"20251031173524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"极大或异常薄长的碰撞体会扩大 AABB，导致候选暴涨"}]},{"ID":"20251031173525-c11kew3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173525-c11kew3","updated":"20251031173547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"必要时拆分为多段更紧的 碰撞体（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Collider"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031173524-9gknf7f","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251031173524-9gknf7f","updated":"20251031173553"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031173524-kd8x0xs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173524-kd8x0xs","updated":"20251031173553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"物理设置中的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20251009111956-dg40ll5","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"接触偏移"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 参数不要过大"}]},{"ID":"20251031173526-hr92xll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173526-hr92xll","updated":"20251031173526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"默认值一般够用，过大会导致接触过早产生，候选与接触点数增多"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031173524-1w4s53s","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251031173524-1w4s53s","updated":"20251031173641"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031173524-iqinkdn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173524-iqinkdn","updated":"20251031173641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"物理设置中的 背面射线检测（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20251009111956-qyk5gfi","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Queries Hit Backfaces"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"） 和 射线检测触发器（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20251011102327-ohmkhh7","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Queries Hit Triggers"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）两个选项，不需要可以关闭"}]},{"ID":"20251031173527-ejwu6li","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173527-ejwu6li","updated":"20251031173527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以减少无用检测的开销"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031173521-s4kf968","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173521-s4kf968","updated":"20251031173521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20251031173656-cvz1axv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251031173656-cvz1axv","updated":"20251103112402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合理使用射线检测和范围检测 API"}]},{"ID":"20251031173706-ct0u4fo","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031173706-ct0u4fo","updated":"20251103112402"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031173723-2cb6utk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031173723-2cb6utk","updated":"20251103112402"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031173723-1v5u5wm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173723-1v5u5wm","updated":"20251031173723"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"NonAlloc"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（非分配）相关 API 替代普通 API"}]},{"ID":"20251031173725-t6dhdae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173725-t6dhdae","updated":"20251031173752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在进行大批量射线和范围检测时，应优先使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"NonAlloc"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 相关API，\n如 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Physics.RaycastNonAlloc"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Physics.OverlapBoxNonAlloc"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Physics.BoxCastNonAlloc"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 等\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"NonAlloc"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 查询和普通查询的差别，本质上是 是否会产生新的数组（内存）分配，直接影响 CPU 性能和内存垃圾回收"}]},{"ID":"20251031173757-mb92mby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173757-mb92mby","updated":"20251031173801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"普通的查询，比如："}]},{"ID":"20251031173806-txcpx9h","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251031173806-txcpx9h","updated":"20251031173817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"RaycastHit[] hits = Physics.RaycastAll(ray, 100f);\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20251031173818-q7502fm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173818-q7502fm","updated":"20251103112402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20230714211249-50q9jzl","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Physics.RaycastAll"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 会返回一个新的数组对象，每次调用都会分配内存，如果频繁调用，会产生大量垃圾，造成 GC，从而带来 CPU 压力"}]},{"ID":"20251031173835-wuc5pzo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173835-wuc5pzo","updated":"20251031173842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而 NonAlloc 查询，比如："}]},{"ID":"20251031173843-gkw089b","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251031173843-gkw089b","updated":"20251031173848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"RaycastHit[] hits = new RaycastHit[10];\nint count = Physics.RaycastNonAlloc(ray, hits, 100f);\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20251031173850-59hj3iu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173850-59hj3iu","updated":"20251103112359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"结果会写进你传入的数组 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"hits"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 里，不会再分配新内存，这种调用方式不会产生垃圾，从而不会造成 GC 压力，也就不会给 CPU 带来压力了"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031173910-euka5ih","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251031173910-euka5ih","updated":"20251031174321"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031173910-gv0dehb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173910-gv0dehb","updated":"20251031173915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"调用相关API时，合理利用最大距离、层级过滤、忽略触发器等参数"}]},{"ID":"20251031173918-1bwtd08","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173918-1bwtd08","updated":"20251031174321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Physics.Raycast"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 等 API 时，合理利用最大距离、层级过滤、忽略触发器等参数，尽量杜绝全局检测"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031173706-kawqx2h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251031173706-kawqx2h","updated":"20251031174308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合理使用布娃娃系统"}]},{"ID":"20251031173951-cbucq3k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031173951-cbucq3k","updated":"20251031174006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"布娃娃系统是 Unity 自带的功能，可以为指定的骨骼自动添加刚体、碰撞器、关节组件\n让角色可以倒地、摔倒、物理模拟，常用于角色死亡时尸体飞出效果"}]},{"ID":"20251031174037-17t3erg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031174037-17t3erg","updated":"20251031174037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GameObject ——\u003e 3D Object ——\u003e Ragdoll..."}]},{"ID":"20251031174038-hweivbe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031174038-hweivbe","updated":"20251031174308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251031174308-477kvo7.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251031173951-4r8nmdo","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031173951-4r8nmdo","updated":"20251031174047"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031174047-ijvvvsb","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031174047-ijvvvsb","updated":"20251031174047"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031174047-gro1mh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031174047-gro1mh2","updated":"20251031174047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少布娃娃系统使用的碰撞器数量"}]},{"ID":"20251031174047-qxtdupn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031174047-qxtdupn","updated":"20251031174057"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以在骨盆、胸部、头部和每个肢体使用各 1 个碰撞器\n相当于只使用 7 个碰撞器，虽然会牺牲一些布娃娃的真实性\n但是可以大大降低消耗成本"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031174047-us46bum","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251031174047-us46bum","updated":"20251031174047"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031174047-i9f2fj0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031174047-i9f2fj0","updated":"20251031174047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"避免布娃娃之间的碰撞"}]},{"ID":"20251031174101-77a5mw6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031174101-77a5mw6","updated":"20251031174101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果允许布娃娃之间碰撞，性能会呈指数级增长\n我们可以利用碰撞层矩阵，让布娃娃处于同一层级后让其不要和自己所在层进行碰撞"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031174047-gms8ycm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251031174047-gms8ycm","updated":"20251031174047"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031174047-6sudl0f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031174047-6sudl0f","updated":"20251031174047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"及时禁用或移除不活跃的布娃娃"}]},{"ID":"20251031174102-i50hto9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031174102-i50hto9","updated":"20251031174102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当布娃娃完成它的使命后，应该及时禁用或者移除它，从而减少开销"}]}]}]}]}